At a Skype meeting, as part of Young Women Parliamentary that is part of S.H.I.N the Israeli movement for women equality activities, a Jewish girls (from Kfar Saba, Herzliya and Bat Yam) and Arab girls (from Kafr Qara and Mardis) met in a video conference with girls from Dayton Ohio. The meeting was held at the Cultural Center of the American Embassy in Jerusalem, which sponsors the project. The girls discussed the issue of leadership of young women and girls. The most prominent role model most Israeli and American girls addressed was their mother. Felicity Aziz of the Cultural Center assisted in organizing the event and Einat Meital, the project coordinator, was responsible for all the coordination and preparation.
[gallery size=full type=slideshow ids=2282,2283,2284,2285,2286,2287,2288,2289 orderby=rand]
&nbsp;

The Young Women Parliament Representative took part in a debate at a subcommittee on combating trafficking in women in the Knesset. The girls were exposed to parliamentary activities dealing with gender issues The subject of the discussion was : &amp;quot;Towards enactment on Prohibition of Prostitution Law - The Ministry of Education preparation on Expanding an Educational Program for Coping with the Prostitution&amp;quot; Representatives from various bodies and organizations participated in the discussion.
&nbsp;
[gallery size=full type=slideshow ids=2293,2294,2295,2296,2297,2298,2299,2300,2301,2302 orderby=rand]

Young WomenParliament Conference December 2018 Bat-Yam &amp;quot;Girls say enough to violence&amp;quot;
The conference started with greetings of:: * Anat Livnat – Mayor&amp;#39;s advisor on the status of women * Malka Abiov – Principal of Hasmonaim Comprehensive school. * Nahed Kanaan, Organizational Consultant Member of S.H.I.N - The Israeli Movement for equal representation of women. The girls participated in an o/d /t activity in the schoolyard, discussing in gender groups led by the 12th grade students. Followed by presentation of the group&amp;#39;s products
&nbsp;
[gallery size=full type=slideshow ids=2304,2305,2306,2307,2308,2309,2310,2311,2313,2314 orderby=rand]
